  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGainOnSalesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※３  固定資産売却益の内訳は次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:30.1pt;"&gt;
